When should you use [style] versus [ngStyle]?

Situation                 	        Recommended approach
Change one CSS property	              [style.color]
Set one property with a unit	        [style.font-size.px]
Apply several computed styles	        [ngStyle]
Define a reusable visual state      	Often use CSS classes with [class] or [ngClass]